{
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "$schema": "https://docs.oasis-open.org/sarif/sarif/v2.1.0/errata01/os/schemas/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "grype",
          "version": "0.99.1",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-28391-busybox",
              "name": "StockMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2022-28391 high vulnerability for busybox package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BusyBox through 1.35.0 allows remote attackers to execute arbitrary code if netstat is used to print a DNS PTR record's value to a VT compatible terminal. Alternatively, the attacker could choose to change the terminal's colors."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2022-28391\nSeverity: high\nPackage: busybox\nVersion: 1.35.0\nFix Version: \nType: binary\nLocation: /bin/busybox\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2022-28391](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-28391)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2022-28391**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | busybox  | 1.35.0  |   | binary  | /bin/busybox  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2022-28391](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-28391)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:generic/busybox@1.35.0"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.8"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-30065-busybox",
              "name": "StockMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2022-30065 high vulnerability for busybox package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A use-after-free in Busybox 1.35-x's awk applet leads to denial of service and possibly code execution when processing a crafted awk pattern in the copyvar function."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2022-30065\nSeverity: high\nPackage: busybox\nVersion: 1.35.0\nFix Version: \nType: binary\nLocation: /bin/busybox\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2022-30065](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-30065)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2022-30065**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | busybox  | 1.35.0  |   | binary  | /bin/busybox  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2022-30065](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-30065)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:generic/busybox@1.35.0"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.8"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-48174-busybox",
              "name": "StockMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2022-48174 critical vulnerability for busybox package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "There is a stack overflow vulnerability in ash.c:6030 in busybox before 1.35. In the environment of Internet of Vehicles, this vulnerability can be executed from command to arbitrary code execution."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2022-48174\nSeverity: critical\nPackage: busybox\nVersion: 1.35.0\nFix Version: \nType: binary\nLocation: /bin/busybox\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2022-48174](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-48174)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2022-48174**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| critical  | busybox  | 1.35.0  |   | binary  | /bin/busybox  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2022-48174](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-48174)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:generic/busybox@1.35.0"
                ],
                "security-severity": "9.8"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
